      "writtenOn": "2026-04-27T14:35:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In device API for PDCs there is no set_vdo at the moment. So this function is purely for testing purposes and there is no implementation of this for PDCs. \n\nBut get_vdo expects list of types for all PDCs. And with previous solution this was ignored since only num_of_vdo was taken into account. \n\nI am not sure what will be approach for setting VDO for other PDCs. It seems to be more complicated.",
